# Local reverse-proxy demo for Lab 12 (Chapter 17).
# HTTP on :8080 inside the proxy container → api:3000 on the Compose network.
#
# Production shape (needs a real DNS name pointing at the host):
#   your.domain {
#     reverse_proxy api:3000
#   }
# Caddy then terminates TLS (Let's Encrypt) on :443. Keep the API published
# only as 127.0.0.1:3000 (or drop the host port and reach it only via the
# Compose network) so the internet hits the proxy, not the app raw.

:8080 {
	reverse_proxy api:3000
}
